<spell-notebook "card theming">
	<header level="1">
		Card
		<header>A card displays site content in a manner similar to a playing card.</>
	</>
	<card-tab-bar showing="theming"/>
	<section>
		<menu class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
			<item link="#tokens">Tokens</>
			<item link="#themes">Themes</>
		</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Theme a card with the public `--ui-card-*` tokens: set one on the element, on any ancestor (a
			`<ui-cards>` group, a region, `:root`), or on the card's box through `::part(card)`. A group's
			spacing tokens, `--ui-cards-*`, go on the group or above it. The shorthand blocks are parts too:
			`image`, `content`, `header`, `meta`, `description` and `extra`.

			The look of the parts inside (`--ui-card-header-color`, `--ui-card-content-padding`,
			`--ui-card-meta-color` ...) is themed the same way, on the card or above it (see the
			[content parts](/components/ui/ui-header.html) page). Never set the `--_ui-*`, `--_card-*` or `--_cards-*` names:
			they're the sheet's private plumbing.

			A card's border, coloured edge and drop shadow are ONE `box-shadow`, so each shadow token takes
			`none` on its own: `--ui-card-shadow: none` drops the drop shadow and keeps the border (set it on the
			card or above it, not through `::part(card)`). A link card's hover border is
			`--ui-card-hover-border-color`.
		</>
		<markdown>
			```css
			ui-card {
			  --ui-card-radius: 0;
			  --ui-card-width: 20em;
			  --ui-card-header-color: var(--ui-violet-text);
			}
			ui-cards {
			  --ui-cards-spacing: 2em;
			}
			```
		</>
		<markdown>Edit a value below to try it.</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-card" playground>
				<ui-card>
					<ui-image alt="Kristy" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%22480%22 height=%22320%22 viewBox=%220 0 30 20%22%3E%3Crect width=%2230%22 height=%2220%22 fill=%22%23cbd5e1%22/%3E%3Cpath d=%22M3 17l7-8 5 6 4-4 8 6z%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%2222%22 cy=%226%22 r=%222%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E"></>
					<ui-content>
						<ui-header link="#kristy">Kristy</>
						<ui-meta>
							<ui-text>Joined in 2013</>
						</>
						<ui-description>Kristy is an art director living in New York.</>
					</>
					<ui-extra>
						<ui-link link="#kristy-friends"><ui-icon name="user"></> 22 Friends</>
					</>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling this component through its tokens.
		</>
	</>
</spell-notebook>
